      "verified_by": "a_lookup_id_within_insn_name_maps_bounds",
      "fine_trace_step": 3,
      "description": "The vulnerable TMS320C64x instruction-name table contains only three contiguous array elements even though `TMS320C64x_insn_name()` later indexes it by raw dense enum value. The embedded `name_map.id` fields do not create sparse array slots, so only indices 0, 1, and 2 are in bounds. The fix replaces the truncated table with one entry per enum value."
    },
